WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:01.079
Let's fix this one.

00:00:01.230 --> 00:00:02.356
Find the two ends of the new

00:00:02.402 --> 00:00:02.878
strand.

00:00:03.412 --> 00:00:04.666
This end is 5-prime.

00:00:04.817 --> 00:00:05.990
This end is 3-prime.

00:00:06.710 --> 00:00:08.358
Now watch where new pieces go.

00:00:08.753 --> 00:00:10.750
Every single one joins the 3-prime end.

00:00:10.936 --> 00:00:12.271
Like a line where people only join

00:00:12.306 --> 00:00:12.933
at the back.

00:00:13.269 --> 00:00:15.103
The 5-prime end never changes.

00:00:15.637 --> 00:00:17.367
Adding at the 3-prime end means DNA

00:00:17.414 --> 00:00:18.830
grows 5-prime to 3-prime.

00:00:19.074 --> 00:00:20.444
Now try the question again.
